      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Full Navy centered route introduction with a layered wave into White; short route title.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-masthead\"><div class=\"ds-intro\"><h1>Layanan</h1><p>Solusi digital sesuai kebutuhan bisnis Anda.</p></div><svg class=\"ds-wave\" viewBox=\"0 0 1440 110\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 10C250 10 260 100 580 64S1050 0 1440 45V110H0Z\" fill=\"#29405a\" opacity=\".45\"/><path d=\"M0 75C370-20 570 15 850 60s440 18 590-30v80H0Z\" fill=\"#63758a\" opacity=\".24\"/><path d=\"M0 65C300 150 550 85 790 45s445-48 650 8v57H0Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></section>",
