    "overview": "The latest user direction pins a close Vodjo.com composition. Conventional centered grid, full-height photography, compact Poppins hierarchy, dense four-work grid, dark three-column services and broad authored waves replace the preceding editorial world. Internal routes use centered Navy mastheads with layered waves; Services uses alternating media/text bands, About pairs CMS feature imagery with copy, and dedicated Contact form fields stay single-column. Wasla branding, original assets, Indonesian copy and truthful CMS content remain authoritative.",
